{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124112","id":4721175887,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGWdtTw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124112","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124112.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124112.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124112","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124112/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124112/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124112/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/81af5af1fd34e5aad8a63b630813eabbc2a23286","number":124112,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Prevent recursive update of scan actions","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #123731\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nWhen an imported file is duplicated, the EFS adds 2 scan actions: ACTION_FILE_ADD and ACTION_FILE_TEST_REIMPORT. During scan update, the fs loops over all actions and then after the loop it does some extras like importing files that need importing. And importing shows a progress dialog. See where this is going? [🙄](https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTvaSGMUyWpw3ChqIV13q4zm77CS5WREqkk3AWqowu9yH0edunF)\r\n\r\nThe progress dialog does `Main::iteration()` to update UI, which runs `NOTIFICATION_PROCESS`, which triggers scan actions again (because `ACTION_FILE_ADD` marks fs as changed), which runs the loop _again_ using the old actions (because they weren't cleared yet), which adds the file _again_.\r\n\r\nThe fix is to prevent calling `_update_scan_actions()` before the previous call hasn't finished (simply clearing the list earlier does not prevent errors). I guess the remaining question is why it started happening only now and why is it project-specific, but I don't even care.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"